cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Enarratio, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Enarratio: accessible, server-rendered charts and scientific figures for the web"
abstract: >-
  Enarratio is a TypeScript library that draws charts and scientific figures
  (bar, line, area and scatter charts with forecasts, heatmaps, networks,
  titer plots and genome tracks, and dashboard primitives such as sparklines
  and event timelines) on the server as accessible, themeable HTML and SVG, with an
  optional browser layer for keyboard navigation, filtering and range
  selection.
type: software
authors:
